{"ordinal":13812,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092042","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Death_097663b","source":"Hunter: Страшно.","target":"Hunter: Mi-e frică.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13813,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092041","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Death_098dc51","source":"Hunter: Будешь выкидывать меня — положи поближе к этим.","target":"Hunter: Dacă mă arunci afară, pune-mă mai aproape de ăștia.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13814,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092040","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Ears_DontShoot_0c2eb10","source":"Hunter: А то я вот поймаю ублюдка, даже не пойму, к чему присматриваться. Ты вот понял?","target":"Hunter: Altfel prind vreun nenorocit și nici nu știu la ce să mă uit. Tu ai înțeles?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13815,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092039","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Ears_DontShoot_02c88bc","source":"Hunter: Если уж рассказывают про новый признак, то хоть бы сказали, на что обращать внимание.","target":"Hunter: Dacă tot vorbesc despre un semn nou, măcar să spună la ce trebuie să fii atent.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13816,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092038","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_DontShoot_0ad0ff3","source":"Hunter: Мне это всё не интересно.","target":"Hunter: Pe mine nu mă interesează toate astea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13817,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092037","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_DontShoot_0c55770","source":"Hunter: Бррррр.","target":"Hunter: Brrr.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13818,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092036","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_DontShoot_0452a9b","source":"Hunter: Знаешь, не люблю я это всё. Фоткаться, резкие вспышки, звуки.","target":"Hunter: Știi, nu-mi place nimic din astea. Să fiu fotografiat, blițurile bruște, zgomotele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13819,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092035","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_DontShoot_0ec2e8f","source":"Hunter: Спасибо. За понимание.","target":"Hunter: Mulțumesc. Că înțelegi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13820,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092034","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Armpit_DontShoot_0bb1827","source":"Hunter: Или это реально паника была?","target":"Hunter: Sau chiar te apucase panica?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13821,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092033","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Armpit_DontShoot_0a95cf3","source":"Hunter: А что тебя смутило? Я же вроде не подхожу по признакам.","target":"Hunter: Ce ți-a dat de bănuit? Parcă nu mă potrivesc cu semnele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13822,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452690092032","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Armpit_DontShoot_008e378","source":"Hunter: Я уж чуть не поверил, что ты выстрелишь.","target":"Hunter: Aproape că am crezut că o să tragi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13823,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452685897738","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_DontShoot_01af6c8","source":"Hunter: Никогда не принимай поспешных выводов. На охоте это всегда приводит к тому, что тебя загрызут.","target":"Hunter: Nu trage niciodată concluzii pripite. La vânătoare, așa sfârșești sfâșiat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13824,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452685897737","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_DontShoot_01fe2fb","source":"Hunter: Вот и правильно.","target":"Hunter: Așa mai merge.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13825,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452685897736","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_DontShoot_06fd095","source":"Hunter: Пойдём за ними охотиться.","target":"Hunter: Hai să mergem la vânătoare după ei.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13826,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452685897735","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_DontShoot_07f21e8","source":"Hunter: Этой ночью пойдёшь тоже душить Гостей?","target":"Hunter: Vii și tu în noaptea asta să sugrumi Musafiri?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13827,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452685897734","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_DontShoot_02022ad","source":"Hunter: Ещё бы!","target":"Hunter: Cum să nu!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13828,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452685897733","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_DontShoot_09e4ce5","source":"Hunter: Вовремя ты одумался.","target":"Hunter: Bine că ți-a venit mintea la cap la timp.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13829,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452685897732","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_DontShoot_0f4973f","source":"Hunter: Но месить-то надо Гостей, а не друг друга.","target":"Hunter: Dar pe Musafiri trebuie să-i batem, nu unii pe alții.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13830,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452685897731","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_DontShoot_0ddbcfd","source":"Hunter: Я понимаю, стресс, все дела.","target":"Hunter: Înțeleg, stresul și toate cele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13831,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452685897730","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Ears_Gun_0e30b2b","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
