{"ordinal":13843,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452681703426","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_Gun_0880c9f","source":"Hunter: Да бля, отстань, ты меня не заставишь.","target":"Hunter: Futu-i, lasă-mă, nu mă poți obliga.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-353.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
