{"ordinal":13848,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452677509128","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_Gun_0fe40f1","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13849,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452677509127","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_Gun_077cd51","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13850,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452677509126","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_Gun_08b377d","source":"Hunter: Не делай резких выводов. Это всегда чревато ошибками.","target":"Hunter: Nu te grăbi să tragi concluzii. Așa riști mereu să greșești.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13851,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452677509125","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_Gun_093c286","source":"Hunter: Подожди, что тебя встревожило? Ты чего, паренёк?","target":"Hunter: Stai, ce te-a neliniștit? Ce-i cu tine, băiete?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13852,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452677509124","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_Gun_09fd436","source":"Hunter: Ну давай, покажи хоть одну нормально работающую больницу! После лечения посмотришь в глаза мне.","target":"Hunter: Hai, arată-mi măcar un spital care funcționează cum trebuie! După tratament poți să te uiți în ochii mei.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13853,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452677509123","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_Gun_07f114d","source":"Hunter: Да пиздец, ты ещё и всех безруких отстреливаешь? Они же ногти не покажут!","target":"Hunter: Futu-i, acum îi împuști și pe toți cei fără mâini? Doar nu-ți pot arăta unghiile!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13854,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452677509122","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_Gun_072611d","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13855,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452677509121","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_Gun_0cacc9a","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13856,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452677509120","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_Gun_0f54f57","source":"Hunter: Я хотя бы ночью вглядываюсь в окна, чтобы никакой Гость не подошёл. Одному тебе будет сложнее.","target":"Hunter: Eu măcar mă uit noaptea pe ferestre, ca să nu se apropie vreun Musafir. Singur o să-ți fie mai greu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13857,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452673314827","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_Gun_0a7ccd1","source":"Hunter: Выдыхай давай, не нажми случайно на курок.","target":"Hunter: Hai, expiră, să nu apeși din greșeală pe trăgaci.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
