{"ordinal":13861,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452673314823","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_Gun_02c3f77","source":"Hunter: Подожди, и что теперь?","target":"Hunter: Stai, și ce urmează?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
