{"ordinal":13866,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452673314818","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Ears_0af33fd","source":"Hunter: ...","target":"Hunter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
