{"ordinal":13868,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452673314816","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_093a38f","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13869,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120521","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_02ac9ad","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13870,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120520","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_024dd45","source":"Hunter: Я не буду фоткаться.","target":"Hunter: Nu mă las fotografiat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13871,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120519","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_0508eed","source":"Hunter: Вспышка напоминает мне грозу, у меня сразу паника.","target":"Hunter: Blițul îmi amintește de furtună și intru imediat în panică.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13872,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120518","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Photo_0d8ed21","source":"Hunter: Да я особо не люблю фоткаться.","target":"Hunter: Pur și simplu nu-mi place prea mult să fiu fotografiat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13873,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120517","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Armpit_08c02c5","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13874,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120516","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Armpit_03a2975","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13875,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120515","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Armpit_01bbe11","source":"Hunter: Ну я-то нормальный мужик, как могло быть иначе?","target":"Hunter: Eu sunt un bărbat normal, cum ar putea fi altfel?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13876,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120514","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Armpit_0d3b012","source":"Hunter: ...","target":"Hunter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13877,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120513","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Armpit_0104620","source":"Hunter: Отлично, чем больше признаков, тем легче отличить своих от Гостей. Верно?","target":"Hunter: Excelent, cu cât sunt mai multe semne, cu atât e mai ușor să-i deosebim pe ai noștri de Musafiri. Nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-354.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13878,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452669120512","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_0c7afcc","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13879,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926217","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_0576aeb","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13880,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926216","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_02c145a","source":"Hunter: Тогда мы снова спокойно заживем.","target":"Hunter: Atunci vom putea trăi din nou liniștiți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13881,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926215","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_03e6d64","source":"Hunter: Но я доберусь до всех. Раздеру их руками.","target":"Hunter: Dar o să-i prind pe toți. O să-i sfâșii cu mâinile mele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13882,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926214","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_0ca8c5d","source":"Hunter: ...","target":"Hunter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13883,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926213","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_0455790","source":"Hunter: ...","target":"Hunter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13884,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926212","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_0a2a522","source":"Hunter: Сейчас, конечно, от такой жизни только серые глаза достаются нам.","target":"Hunter: Acum, firește, din cauza vieții ăsteia, nu ne alegem decât cu ochi cenușii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13885,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926211","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_0a102f8","source":"Hunter: Ай-ай, больно, осторожно.","target":"Hunter: Au, au, doare! Ai grijă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13886,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926210","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_0e2dcb6","source":"Hunter: ...","target":"Hunter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13887,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926209","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_0699b69","source":"Hunter: Когда я одного из Гостей мочил, кинул мне то ли землю, то ли говно какое в глаза. Постоянно болят теперь.","target":"Hunter: Când îl omoram pe unul dintre Musafiri, mi-a aruncat în ochi ceva, pământ sau vreun rahat. De atunci mă dor mereu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13888,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452664926208","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_05f6eaa","source":"Hunter: А от недавнего случая глаза у меня только красные.","target":"Hunter: Iar după ce s-a întâmplat de curând, ochii mei sunt doar roșii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13889,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731914","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Eyes_0923f29","source":"Hunter: Знаешь, у меня когда-то был цвет в глазах.","target":"Hunter: Știi, ochii mei aveau cândva culoare.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13890,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731913","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_0d64763","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13891,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731912","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_052d166","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13892,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731911","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_0cbcc7f","source":"Hunter: Тебе советую делать то же самое.","target":"Hunter: Te sfătuiesc să faci la fel.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13893,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731910","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_0861937","source":"Hunter: Их так даже проще убивать!","target":"Hunter: Așa e chiar mai ușor să-i omori!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13894,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731909","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_070b3be","source":"Hunter: Конечно, у меня руки будут грязные, я хожу по ночам копать этих чертей.","target":"Hunter: Normal că am mâinile murdare, umblu noaptea și-i dezgrop pe diavolii ăștia.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13895,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731908","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_0f1082f","source":"Hunter: ...","target":"Hunter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13896,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731907","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Hands_0ac0c90","source":"Hunter: Погнали-погнали.","target":"Hunter: Hai, hai, să mergem.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13897,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731906","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_079718d","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13898,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731905","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_0be228a","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13899,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452660731904","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_0bfd60e","source":"Hunter: Я к стоматологу ни ногой. Дома отпиздили, конечно, зато ко врачу так и не попал.","target":"Hunter: La dentist nu calc. Acasă mi-am luat-o rău de tot, dar la doctor tot n-am ajuns.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13900,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452656537610","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_09852c0","source":"Hunter: Мне родители хотели в детстве брекеты ставить. А я в этот день сбежал.","target":"Hunter: Când eram copil, ai mei voiau să-mi pună aparat dentar. În ziua aceea am fugit.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13901,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452656537609","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_036a7ed","source":"Hunter: Ну, может, ты ещё и жопу не вытираешь? Конечно, у меня белые зубы! Я не дикарь.","target":"Hunter: Ce, poate nici la cur nu te ștergi? Normal că am dinții albi! Nu sunt un sălbatic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13902,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452656537608","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_0656e28","source":"Hunter: ...","target":"Hunter: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13903,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452656537607","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Hunter_Teeth_033625f","source":"Hunter: Зубы? Ну хорошо, давай покажу.","target":"Hunter: Dinții? Bine, hai să ți-i arăt.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-355.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
